  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming education in Moldova through Model Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme&#x2019;s general Programme Objective is as follows: Enhanced quality and effectiveness of Moldovas education system through the transformation of district schools into Model Schools, planned to be achieved through the following Outcomes and Outputs: Five schools are transformed into Model Schools with a modern learning environment and facilities enabling better learning outcomes and improved efficiency of the school network and Facilitate the development of 21st century skills of student</narrative>
  </description>
